policy-authorize-ticket-tags: TPM2_PolicyAuthorize accepts TPM_ST_MESSAGE_VERIFIED and TPM_ST_DIGEST_VERIFIED tickets

Classification: spec-deviation bug fix.

Specification (TPM 2.0 Library, Part 3 (version 185), "TPM2_PolicyAuthorize",
"General Description"):

  "This signature over toBeSigned is verified using TPM2_VerifySignature(),
  TPM2_VerifySequenceComplete(), or TPM2_VerifyDigestSignature(). Each of
  these commands produces a TPMT_TK_VERIFIED ticket. The ticket is then used
  in TPM2_PolicyAuthorize() to satisfy the policy."

Specification (TPM 2.0 Library, Part 2 (version 185), "TPMT_TK_VERIFIED"):

  "HMAC_contextAlg(proof, (tag || digestOrMessage || keyName || metadata))"
  ... "The metadata is the serialized TPMU_TK_VERIFIED_META contents according
  to the tag value."

TPM2_PolicyAuthorize recomputes every checkTicket as a TPM_ST_VERIFIED ticket
over aHash = H_nameAlg(approvedPolicy || policyRef), so a valid
TPM_ST_MESSAGE_VERIFIED ticket of TPM2_VerifySequenceComplete() (over the
message approvedPolicy || policyRef) or TPM_ST_DIGEST_VERIFIED ticket of
TPM2_VerifyDigestSignature() (over aHash computed with the hash algorithm in
its metadata, followed by that algorithm) never matches and the command fails
with TPM_RC_VALUE. The ticket is now recomputed according to its tag, as in
tpm-rs.
diff --git a/TPMCmd/tpm/src/command/EA/PolicyAuthorize.c b/TPMCmd/tpm/src/command/EA/PolicyAuthorize.c
--- a/TPMCmd/tpm/src/command/EA/PolicyAuthorize.c
+++ b/TPMCmd/tpm/src/command/EA/PolicyAuthorize.c
@@ -5,6 +5,54 @@
 
 #  include "Policy_spt_fp.h"
 
+// tpm-rs differential testing -- C-ref spec deviation fix (NOT determinism):
+// recomputes a TPM_ST_MESSAGE_VERIFIED or TPM_ST_DIGEST_VERIFIED 'checkTicket'
+// (Part 2, TPMT_TK_VERIFIED: HMAC(proof, (tag || digestOrMessage || keyName ||
+// metadata))). The message of a TPM_ST_MESSAGE_VERIFIED ticket is
+// (approvedPolicy || policyRef); the digest of a TPM_ST_DIGEST_VERIFIED ticket
+// is aHash computed with the hash algorithm in its metadata, which is also the
+// metadata.
+static TPM_RC PolicyAuthorizeTicketCompute(PolicyAuthorize_In* in,     // IN
+                                           TPMT_TK_VERIFIED*   ticket  // OUT
+)
+{
+    TPM_RC      result;
+    TPM2B_PROOF proof;
+    HMAC_STATE  hmacState;
+    //
+    ticket->tag       = in->checkTicket.tag;
+    ticket->hierarchy = in->checkTicket.hierarchy;
+    result            = HierarchyGetProof(in->checkTicket.hierarchy, &proof);
+    if(result != TPM_RC_SUCCESS)
+        return result;
+    ticket->digest.t.size =
+        CryptoCommon_HmacStart2B(&hmacState, CONTEXT_INTEGRITY_HASH_ALG, &proof.b);
+    MemorySet(proof.b.buffer, 0, proof.b.size);
+    CryptoCommon_DigestUpdateInt(&hmacState, sizeof(TPM_ST), ticket->tag);
+    if(in->checkTicket.tag == TPM_ST_MESSAGE_VERIFIED)
+    {
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hmacState.hashState, &in->approvedPolicy.b);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hmacState.hashState, &in->policyRef.b);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hmacState.hashState, &in->keySign.b);
+    }
+    else
+    {
+        TPM_ALG_ID   metadataHash = in->checkTicket.metadata.digestVerified;
+        HASH_STATE   hashState;
+        TPM2B_DIGEST aHash;
+        //
+        aHash.t.size = CryptoHash_HashStart(&hashState, metadataHash);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hashState, &in->approvedPolicy.b);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hashState, &in->policyRef.b);
+        CryptoCommon_HashEnd2B(&hashState, &aHash.b);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hmacState.hashState, &aHash.b);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdate2B(&hmacState.hashState, &in->keySign.b);
+        CryptoCommon_DigestUpdateInt(&hmacState, sizeof(TPM_ALG_ID), metadataHash);
+    }
+    CryptoCommon_HmacEnd2B(&hmacState, &ticket->digest.b);
+    return TPM_RC_SUCCESS;
+}
+
 /*(See part 3 specification)
 // Change policy by a signature from authority
 */
@@ -76,8 +124,14 @@ TPM2_PolicyAuthorize(PolicyAuthorize_In* in,   // IN: input parameter list
         CryptoCommon_HashEnd2B(&hashState, &authHash.b);
 
         // re-compute TPMT_TK_VERIFIED
-        result = CryptoCommon_TicketComputeVerified(
-            in->checkTicket.hierarchy, &authHash, &in->keySign, &ticket);
+        // tpm-rs differential testing -- C-ref spec deviation fix (NOT determinism):
+        // the ticket is recomputed according to its tag; only a TPM_ST_VERIFIED
+        // ticket is over (TPM_ST_VERIFIED || aHash || keySign).
+        if(in->checkTicket.tag == TPM_ST_VERIFIED)
+            result = CryptoCommon_TicketComputeVerified(
+                in->checkTicket.hierarchy, &authHash, &in->keySign, &ticket);
+        else
+            result = PolicyAuthorizeTicketCompute(in, &ticket);
         if(result != TPM_RC_SUCCESS)
             return result;
 
